\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\ql\ltrpar{
A few good habits help a lot:}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain  1.\tab}\ilvl0\ls2 \fi-283\li0\lin0\ql\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\ltrpar{\cs16\rtlch\ab\ltrch\hich\ab\dbch\ab\loch\b
Ask one focused question at a time}{
 \line Example: \u8220\'93Why does this linker error happen?\u8221\'94 is better than \u8220\'93Can you review the whole GUI?\u8221\'94}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain  2.\tab}\ilvl0\ls2 \fi-283\li0\lin0\ql\tx709\fi-283\li709\lin709\ltrpar{\cs16\rtlch\ab\ltrch\hich\ab\dbch\ab\loch\b
Paste only the relevant files or excerpts}{
 \line If the issue is in , don\u8217\'92t include unrelated files unless they matter. }{\cs17\rtlch\af4\ltrch\hich\af4\dbch\af7\loch\f4
gui/CMakeLists.txt}
