State the goal and the failure clearly}{
 \line Include:}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af5\ltrch\hich\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl1\ls2 \fi-283\li0\lin0\ql\tx1418\fi-283\li1418\lin1418\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{
what you expected }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \rtlch\af5\ltrch\hich\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl1\ls2 \fi-283\li0\lin0\ql\tx1418\fi-283\li1418\lin1418\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{
what happened }
